<title>USA: EuroMed Inc files combined fin results.</title>
<headline>EuroMed Inc files combined fin results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EuroMed Inc said on Monday that it filed a Form 8-K with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) containing combined and unaudited financial results, which give effect to the acquisition of Mutarestes, as if it had occurred on January 1 1995.</p>
<p>For the year ended December 31 1995, the combined net income was $1,539,000 or $0.38 per share. For the six months ended June 30 1996, the combined net income was $848,000 or $0.21 per share.</p>
</text>
